        "Content": "COMING SOON... \r\n\r\nENQUIRE TODAY FOR PRIVATE ACCESS TO A PRE-MARKET VIEWING.\r\n\r\n2 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM\r\n\r\nDixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 2 Riverside to the Dublin 22 property market.\r\n\r\nThis well-proportioned two-bedroom terraced home comes to the market offering an excellent opportunity for a range of buyers, ideally positioned within a quiet and well-established development in a highly convenient location.\r\n\r\nThis property has been renovated to the highest of standards and is perfect for anybody seeking a turnkey home!\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance porch, living room and kitchen/dining room. Upstairs are two bedrooms and a main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nRiverside is a small, private development located on Watery Lane, just a two-minute stroll from the centre of Clondalkin Village. Residents can enjoy easy access to a wide range of local amenities, including bars, restaurants, cafés, shops and the Irish Cultural Centre, Áras Chrónáin. A number of primary and secondary schools are also within walking distance, while several main bus routes are located just a short distance from the development, providing convenient access to the surrounding areas and nearby Luas services.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
